                    <p>
                        Its key strength lies in its scalability and efficiency, allowing for rapid deployment of an industrial-grade solution capable of addressing a broad array of tasks, from traffic monitoring on public roads to object tracking in shopping centers, security checkpoints, factory workshops, and conveyor belts.

